andura%20Mountain\">Vandura Mountain</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Deeper%20Banuta\">Deeper Banuta</a> (single spawn <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32732,32601,14\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32732, 32601, 14)</a>, double spawn <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32746,32571,14\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32746, 32571, 14)</a>), <a href=\"#/wiki/Ankrahmun%20Libraries\">Serpentine Tower</a> (unreachable), deep into the <a href=\"#/wiki/Formorgar%20Mines\">Formorgar Mines</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Arena%20and%20Zoo%20Quarter\">Arena and Zoo Quarter</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Demon%20Forge\">The Dark Path</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Lower%20Spike\">Lower Spike</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Chyllfroest\">Chyllfroest</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Medusa%20Tower\">Medusa Tower</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Underground%20Glooth%20Factory\">Underground Glooth Factory</a> (west side).\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tBehemoths attack their enemies and chase them with their great speed.<br/><br/>A behemoth attacks in melee range. A behemoth never retreats.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 54,315 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 500 samples.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">%\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\"><img alt=\"Gold Coin\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"laz